Responsible (R): Project Manager / Construction PMO Leader
Accountable (A): Project Manager / Construction PMO Leader
Duration: 2-3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5283_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5283_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5283_Task7" name="Establish weekly progress reporting routines and review timelines.">
